WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
You go back first. I'll wait here.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,520
What if I lose the certificate?

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,920
Someone is handling the case. You are a living person.

4
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,720
I promised Shen Zi to take him back

5
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,520
How can I enter that door empty-handed?

6
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,920
Then you wait, I'll look at you

7
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:16,030
Deng Chengliang was found not guilty

8
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:17,830
The judge dismissed the case

9
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:19,230
Then he can go back with me now

10
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,430
Still have to go through the process

11
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:23,030
The file has to go through three hands. I can't go back today.

12
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,430
Then when will we wait?

13
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:26,230
As little as three days, as much as half a month

14
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:28,430
If he were a human being, he wouldn't breathe like this

15
00:00:28,630 --> 00:00:32,190
Xiaotie, are you awake?

16
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:37,660
I always quarrel with him

17
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,890
Certificate Think about it

18
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:41,490
Did anything happen thirty years ago?

19
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:43,490
I built a house thirty years ago

20
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:46,090
I borrowed rice noodles and beans from Li Siquan

21
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:48,690
Later he died and I never paid him back.

22
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:49,890
He sued you

23
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:51,290
Later his son came to the city

24
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:52,690
I paid back ten times the price

25
00:00:52,690 --> 00:00:54,090
I thought this battle was lost

26
00:00:54,090 --> 00:00:56,220
The tone in his heart didn't change

27
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:58,420
He said you won't pay him back until he dies.

28
00:00:58,450 --> 00:01:00,050
It's a bad conscience

29
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:05,160
I can't help him

30
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:08,560
This is all thanks to Brother Li, who has a strong relationship with the Heroes Hall.

31
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:11,560
Dare you know when you will die?

32
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:13,760
Who knows when he will die

33
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,160
Then you don’t even know

34
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,960
Where does Zheng Chengliang know?

35
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,560
You can't blame him for this

36
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:20,700
It makes sense

37
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:22,500
Certificate Don’t worry

38
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:26,430
The judge will return the surgery to you. Thank you.

39
00:01:26,430 --> 00:01:28,630
Thank you all old immortals

40
00:01:28,630 --> 00:01:31,030
Xiaotie, go back and check the door of Zi's house.

41
00:01:31,030 --> 00:01:32,230
You can come in anytime

42
00:01:32,230 --> 00:01:33,430
The old card battle is over

43
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:36,030
But I still have Shadow Sleeve Mountain to go to.
